#N canvas 563 227 1004 732 10;
#X text 10 20 tetra2ambi~ - Tetrahedral to Ambisonic Converter;
#X text 10 40 Converts 4-channel A-format signal to B-format ambisonics;
#X text 10 60 using configurable 4x4 transformation matrix.;
#X text 10 100 Input: 4-channel A-format signal;
#X text 10 120 Output: 4-channel B-format signal (W X Y Z);
#X text 10 160 Messages:;
#X text 10 180 matrix [16 floats] - Set 4x4 conversion matrix;
#X text 10 200 preset [symbol] - Load preset (tetramic;
#X text 10 220 filter [float] - Set high-pass filter frequency (Hz);
#X text 10 240 reset - Reset to default matrix;
#X text 10 260 print - Display current matrix;
#X text 10 300 Creation args: [filter_freq] (default: 0);
#X text 10 340 Example usage:;
#X text 10 360 [tetra2ambi~ 80] - with 80Hz high-pass filter;
#X text 10 380 [tetra2ambi~] - no filtering;
#X text 10 420 Matrix format (row-major):;
#X text 10 440 W = m0*A0 + m1*A1 + m2*A2 + m3*A3;
#X text 10 460 X = m4*A0 + m5*A1 + m6*A2 + m7*A3;
#X text 10 480 Y = m8*A0 + m9*A1 + m10*A2 + m11*A3;
#X text 10 500 Z = m12*A0 + m13*A1 + m14*A2 + m15*A3;
#X obj 404 326 tetra2ambi~;
#X msg 440 292 print;
#X obj 423 226 snake~ in 4;
#X obj 424 175 sig~;
